{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>蘋果預計於明年春季推出 iPhone 18 及 iPhone Air 2，在發佈前於社交媒體流出的模型機照片，則進一步顯示兩款裝置的外觀，當中 iPhone Air 2 的相機系統出現較大改動。</p>\n<h2>iPhone Air 2 增設超廣角鏡頭</h2>\n<p>Sonny Dickson 在 X 發佈 iPhone Air 2 的模型機照片，顯示新機採用雙鏡頭系統；至於標準版 iPhone 18，外觀與 iPhone 17 相比大致不變。</p>\n<p>第一代 iPhone Air 只配備單一 4,800 萬像素主鏡頭，據報第二代將加入超廣角鏡頭。從模型機所見，兩顆鏡頭在藥丸形相機平台上橫向排列，與 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 的排列方式相似。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"HXkVRPhbQAAcjA9\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"657\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/HXkVRPhbQAAcjA9.webp\" width=\"599\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"HXkVRPfawAAiDbq\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"946\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/HXkVRPfawAAiDbq.webp\" width=\"924\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>傳採用 A20 Pro 與均熱板</h2>\n<p>除雙鏡頭系統外，iPhone Air 2 預計採用 A20 Pro 晶片。蘋果亦據報正著手改善電池續航；《The Information》報道該機將配備均熱板散熱系統，該技術由蘋果在 iPhone 17 Pro 首次採用。另有報道指，該機將採用較小的動態島。</p>\n<h2>iPhone 18 標準版變動不大</h2>\n<p>標準版 iPhone 18 據報採用蘋果 A20 晶片。郭明錤報道指，該機記憶體為 9GB，較 iPhone 17 的 8GB 增加。預期這是幅度溫和的年度更新，蘋果的重點在於降低成本。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 iPhone Air 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/air01.webp\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<figure>\n<blockquote><p>First look at the iPhone 18 Air and iPhone 18 dummy units. The biggest change is the iPhone 18 Air, which now features two rear cameras instead of one, while the standard iPhone 18 retains a design similar to the iPhone 17. <a href=\"https://t.co/MdOVuwPlm3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/MdOVuwPlm3</a></p>— Sonny Dickson (@SonnyDickson) <a href=\"https://x.com/SonnyDickson/status/2123752090745061824?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 20, 2026</a></blockquote>\n</figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:23:58.434381+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":864,"images":3,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:37.332036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:24.724840+00:00","content_hash":"19db10d915e03d556e21014d09f6c06ead0c1e2e1b06f670351741b804e7dc31","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}